The source snapshots retain the Linux kernel's original SPDX identifiers
and copyright notices. Extracted fixtures combine GPL-2.0 kernel functions
with GPL-2.0-only ARM DMA code, and are distributed under GPL-2.0-only.
Original notices are repeated at the beginning of each extracted fixture.

The model scaffolding, extractor and replay tool were prepared with OpenAI
Codex (GPT-6) assistance for this bringup. SG objects, VB2 lookups, IOMMU
allocation/mapping and core services are synthetic. Host Linux UAPI
videodev2.h provides format constants; these are not kernel-native headers.

